@Lidessa.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5144
# Pegar aquí el "token" que devuelve el login de un admin.
@adminToken = PEGAR_TOKEN_ADMIN

### Salud (confirma conexión a la base)
GET {{Lidessa.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health

### Login admin
POST {{Lidessa.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "tu-correo@ejemplo.com", "password": "tu-clave" }

# ───────── Configuración del sitio ─────────

### Leer (público)
GET {{Lidessa.Api_HostAddress}}/api/site-settings

### Guardar (admin) — sin token debe dar 401; con token de no-admin, 403
PUT {{Lidessa.Api_HostAddress}}/api/site-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "+57 333 237 1006",
  "email": "administrativo@lidessa.com",
  "address": "Cra. 71 #46-28, Laureles, Medellín, Antioquia",
  "schedule": "Lunes – Viernes: 7:00 a.m. – 4:30 p.m."
}

### Guardar con correo inválido — debe dar 400
PUT {{Lidessa.Api_HostAddress}}/api/site-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "phone": "1", "email": "no-es-correo", "address": "x", "schedule": "x" }

# ───────── Blog (Converge) ─────────

### Listar (público)
GET {{Lidessa.Api_HostAddress}}/api/blog-posts

### Crear (admin)
POST {{Lidessa.Api_HostAddress}}/api/blog-posts
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Publicación de prueba",
  "excerpt": "Texto de prueba",
  "publishedOn": "2026-10-19",
  "imageUrl": "",
  "author": "Lidessa",
  "phone": null,
  "externalLink": null
}

# ───────── PQRSF ─────────

### Radicar sin sesión (público)
POST {{Lidessa.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pqrsf-tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticketType": "Petición",
  "name": "Prueba",
  "email": "prueba@ejemplo.com",
  "phone": "3000000000",
  "subject": "Asunto de prueba",
  "message": "Mensaje de prueba"
}

### Radicar con tipo inválido — debe dar 400
POST {{Lidessa.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pqrsf-tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ticketType": "Otro", "subject": "x", "message": "x" }

### Listar (admin)
GET {{Lidessa.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pqrsf-tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# ───────── Servicios ─────────

### Listar activos (público)
GET {{Lidessa.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services

### Listar todos, incluidos inactivos (admin)
GET {{Lidessa.Api_HostAddress}}/api/services/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Categorías (requiere sesión)
GET {{Lidessa.Api_HostAddress}}/api/service-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
